WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,090
Ru Tiao, that thing again

2
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:16,230
Today is just the first day

3
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,110
Don't ask for too much

4
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:20,070
