8
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:30,630
Then I won't ask for orders.

9
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,750
Next is outdoor training

10
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,530
Be mentally prepared

11
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,720
Hope these people wait a while

12
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,960
Can I continue to show my filial piety?

13
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,390
These people are fighting to loosen his neck and eyebrow bones

14
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,320
Looks like I need to use some force

15
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,320
Help us find a few blows
